   1348  29be							; Splash (odd frames): a cannonball's burst also hits every other monster on
   1349  29be							; its shelf within SPLASH pixels of the one it hit; a jet's burst (bit 7 of
   1350  29be							; splashN; no monster hit first) hits every monster on its shelf. One monster
   1351  29be							; is checked a frame (five frames a burst), which keeps the frame time bounded
   1352  29be				   Splash
   1353  29be					      SUBROUTINE
   1354  29be		       ad cb f0 	      lda	R_splashN
