   1475  2a88							; JetAct (X = a launched jet): four pixels right per update; every enemy on
   1476  2a88							; its shelf takes 10 damage as the nose passes its middle. Nose and middle
   1477  2a88							; close by at most 7 pixels an update, so each enemy is hit exactly once.
   1478  2a88				   JetAct
